abstract: >-
  Upload-ready lightweight companion package for reference-conditional
  screening of cross-farm wind-power forecasting updates. It includes public
  data manifests, a tested governance-layer implementation, a CSV command-line
  workflow, and manuscript tables exported as CSV.
keywords:
